---
import OfficialLayout from '../layouts/OfficialLayout.astro'
---

<OfficialLayout title="中立评估" description="珠江国际商事调解院 - 中立评估 Early Neutral Evaluation">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950 via-emerald-900 to-gray-900 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-emerald-950 dark:to-gray-900">
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl" />
    <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-0 w-80 h-80 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl" />

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-emerald-300/60 dark:text-emerald-400/50 mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">首页</a>
        <svg class="w-3 h-3" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
        <span class="text-emerald-200 dark:text-emerald-300">中立评估</span>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 text-xs text-white/80 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"/><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"/></svg>
          <span>Early Neutral Evaluation · ENE</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">中立评估</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg sm:text-xl text-emerald-200/80 dark:text-emerald-300/70 font-mono">Early Neutral Evaluation</p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          由中立第三方专家对案件进行客观评估，结合 AI 智能分析与专家深度判断，
          帮助各方准确了解争议的法律前景与潜在风险，为纠纷高效解决提供专业依据。
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8">
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">30 天</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-emerald-300/70 mt-1">评估周期</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">30-50%</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-emerald-300/70 mt-1">成本节约</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">AI + 专家</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-emerald-300/70 mt-1">双轨保障</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is Neutral Evaluation -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">什么是中立评估</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              中立评估（Early Neutral Evaluation，简称 ENE）是一种高效的替代性争议解决方式。
              由具有专业知识和经验的中立第三方，对案件的事实、法律适用及争议焦点进行客观分析，
              出具专业评估意见。
            </p>
            <p>
              珠江国际商事调解院的中立评估平台整合了 <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">AI 智能分析</strong>
              与 <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">专家深度判断</strong> 双轨路径，
              参照 WIPO 专家裁决制度及 PMAC-UPC 服务体系架构设计，
              致力于为当事人提供高效、专业、保密的中立评估服务。
            </p>
            <p>
              评估意见可选择约束性或非约束性模式。非约束性意见供当事人参考和解；
              约束性意见则具有等同裁决效力，可快速定纷止争。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/20 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-800/30 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="9" y2="13"/><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="17" y2="17"/></svg>
              传统困境
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-red-600/80 dark:text-red-300/60">
              <li>技术分析高度专业化，非专业人员难以独立判断</li>
              <li>案件审理周期长（12-24 个月）</li>
              <li>专利估值缺乏标准化方法</li>
              <li>专家资源分散，匹配效率低</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/30 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
              平台方案
            </h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-emerald-600/80 dark:text-emerald-300/60">
              <li>AI 预分析 + 专家终裁，双重保障</li>
              <li>全流程在线化，目标 30 天完成</li>
              <li>多方法估值引擎（收益/市场/成本/许可费率）</li>
              <li>结构化专家库 + 智能推荐匹配</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process Steps -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900/50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">评估流程</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-base lg:text-lg">4 步完成专业中立评估</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"/><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-200 dark:text-gray-700">01</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">提交评估申请</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">当事人在线填写案件信息，上传专利证书、权利要求书及相关证据材料，选择评估范围。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="10" x="3" y="11" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"/><path d="M12 7v4"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="16" y2="16"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="16" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-200 dark:text-gray-700">02</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">AI 智能分析</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">系统自动完成权利要求解释、技术特征分解、侵权比对分析及专利估值，生成结构化分析报告。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-200 dark:text-gray-700">03</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">专家独立评估</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">指派领域专家审阅材料与 AI 报告，进行专业判断并出具初步评估意见。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"/><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"/><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-200 dark:text-gray-700">04</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">出具最终意见</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">综合双方材料与反馈，专家出具正式评估结论，为纠纷解决提供专业依据。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Evaluation Scope -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">灵活评估范围</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-base lg:text-lg">根据实际需求，灵活选择评估深度与范围</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">仅侵权分析</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">聚焦专利侵权是否成立，逐项比对技术特征，出具侵权可能性专业判断。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">仅估值分析</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">聚焦专利价值评估与合理许可费率确定，采用多元估值方法提供量化依据。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-violet-50 dark:bg-violet-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">全面评估</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">涵盖侵权分析与估值评估的综合服务，为纠纷提供全方位专业意见。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">非约束性评估</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">评估意见供当事人参考，用于评估和解可能性与诉讼风险，不具有强制执行力。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-6">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">约束性评估</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">双方约定评估意见具有等同裁决效力，对当事人产生约束力，快速定纷止争。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-800 to-emerald-900 dark:from-gray-900 dark:to-emerald-950 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">申请中立评估</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-emerald-200 dark:text-emerald-300 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        无论您身处何地，我们的在线平台都能为您提供专业、高效的中立评估服务
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white text-emerald-900 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-emerald-50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl"
      >
        <svg class="w-4.5 h-4.5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
        联系我们咨询
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</OfficialLayout>
